- Build 8e01e722-e76e-4492-840b-2b50c9f5df0b completed with SUCCESS (all 26 OCA repos and pip wheels installed).
- Diagnosed runtime failure in container initialization: PermissionError [Errno 13] Permission denied: '/var/lib/odoo/filestore'.
- Root Cause: Railway volume 'odooca-fmcg-volume' mounts as root:root into /var/lib/odoo. Container starting as 'USER odoo' lacks write permission.
- Applied fix:
